Feature: a media element's player, and its demuxer's tap, for the embedder.

The embedder's renderer code lists a frame's <audio> and <video> elements
and taps the demuxer of one of their players (patches/1031): a new
blink::GetWebMediaPlayer(WebElement) gives an element's player, and
WebMediaPlayer::GetMediaCapture() a WebMediaCapture of it, which
WebMediaPlayerImpl is: what it plays (a file, Media Source Extensions,
HLS), its codecs, whether it is encrypted, and SetCaptureTap() on its
demuxer. Players without one (WebRTC and camera streams) give nullptr.

